Spec: SpecDD Code Reference Extractor

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Extract explicit backticked code reference candidates from SpecDD text.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractor.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractor.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractorBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Extract only balanced single-line spans delimited with single backticks.
  Use the text inside the backticks as the candidate text.
  Expose the inner content range separately from the full backtick span range.
  Ignore empty code spans.
  Ignore unmatched opening backticks.
  Never cross line boundaries.

Must not:
  Resolve paths or symbols.
  Report diagnostics.
